 ___ risen sharply this year.", "options": ["has", "have", "having", "had have"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "Complète : It was the volunteers'' dedication ___ made the event successful.", "options": ["that", "who is", "which", "what"], "correct_index": 0}, {"question": "Complète : The bridge ___ inspected next week for safety.", "options": ["will be", "is being", "has been", "would"], "correct_index": 0}], "part_b": [{"title": "Annonce (logement)", "passage": "Applications are now open for affordable housing units in the new riverside development. Interested residents must submit proof of income and complete the online application by the end of the month. Priority will be given to families and key workers.", "questions": [{"question": "What is now open?", "options": ["Job applications", "Applications for affordable housing", "A new school", "A shopping center"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "Where is the development located?", "options": ["Downtown", "Riverside", "The suburbs", "Not specified"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "What must applicants submit?", "options": ["A resume", "Proof of income", "A rental history", "A bank guarantee"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "How should the application be completed?", "options": ["In person", "Online", "By mail", "By phone"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "When is the deadline?", "options": ["Next week", "End of the month", "End of the year", "No deadline"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "Who will be given priority?", "options": ["Students only", "Families and key workers", "Retirees only", "Single applicants"], "correct_index": 1}]}, {"title": "Article général (transport urbain)", "passage": "Many cities are investing in electric buses to reduce air pollution and noise levels. Although the initial cost of electric buses is higher than diesel models, city officials argue that lower maintenance and fuel costs make them more economical in the long run.", "questions": [{"question": "Why are cities investing in electric buses?", "options": ["To increase noise", "To reduce air pollution and noise", "To raise ticket prices", "To reduce bus routes"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "How does the initial cost compare to diesel buses?", "options": ["Lower", "Higher", "The same", "Not mentioned"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "What do officials argue makes electric buses economical?", "options": ["Higher ticket sales", "Lower maintenance and fuel costs", "Government subsidies only", "Faster speeds"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "Over what timeframe are electric buses said to be more economical?", "options": ["Immediately", "In the long run", "Never", "Only during summer"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "What is the overall tone of the passage?", "options": ["Critical of electric buses", "Balanced, presenting costs and benefits", "Purely promotional", "Neutral with no opinion given"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "What is the main topic?", "options": ["Bus driver training", "The shift to electric buses", "Traffic congestion", "Airport transport"], "correct_index": 1}]}, {"title": "Avis client (cours en ligne)", "passage": "I signed up for this online course to improve my public speaking skills. The lessons were well-structured and the instructor gave helpful feedback on my recorded practice sessions. My only criticism is that the platform occasionally had technical issues during live sessions.", "questions": [{"question": "Why did the reviewer sign up for the course?", "options": ["To learn a language", "To improve public speaking skills", "To get a certificate only", "To meet new people"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "How were the lessons described?", "options": ["Disorganized", "Well-structured", "Too short", "Boring"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": "What did the instructor provide?", "options": ["No feedback", "Helpful feedback on practice sessions", "Only written materials", "A final exam only"], "correct_index": 1}, {"question": 